    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84206" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποθ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθος</span>
			, c. gen., <i>longing, desire for . . ,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμεῖο ποθὴν ἀπεόντος ἔχουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.362
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.368
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῇ ποθῇ</span>
			<i>from longing after</i> thee, <i><span class="en">
				19.321
			</span></i>: in late Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ψυχροῦ ἠέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. rei,
				<i>want</i> of . . , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.514
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				546
			</span></i>.</div>
